{
  "info": {
    "_postman_id": "a1b2c3d4-e5f6-7890-abcd-ef1234567890",
    "name": "BetMate API",
    "description": "BetMate API — Express + Apollo GraphQL + Prisma\n\n**Flow:**\n1. Run **Signup** or **Login** → `accessToken` and `refreshToken` are captured automatically into collection variables.\n2. All authenticated requests (Me, Logout, Refresh Token) use `{{accessToken}}` via Bearer auth — no manual copy-paste.\n3. Switch environments (Local / Staging) using the env selector.\n\n**Collection variables auto-managed:**\n- `accessToken` — set by Signup/Login, cleared by Logout\n- `refreshToken` — set by Signup/Login, updated by Refresh Token\n- `userId` / `userEmail` — set by Signup/Login for convenience",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "auth": {
    "type": "bearer",
    "bearer": [
      {
        "key": "token",
        "value": "{{accessToken}}",
        "type": "string"
      }
    ]
  },
  "variable": [
    {
      "key": "accessToken",
      "value": "",
      "type": "string",
      "description": "JWT access token — auto-populated by Signup / Login"
    },
    {
      "key": "refreshToken",
      "value": "",
      "type": "string",
      "description": "Refresh token — auto-populated by Signup / Login"
    },
    {
      "key": "userId",
      "value": "",
      "type": "string",
      "description": "Logged-in user ID — auto-populated by Signup / Login"
    },
    {
      "key": "userEmail",
      "value": "",
      "type": "string",
      "description": "Logged-in user email — auto-populated by Signup / Login"
    }
  ],
  "item": [
